==Description==
The '''Inverted Nametag''' is a {{Color|Rare}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|2,000}}.

The '''Inverted Nametag''' is an inverted version of the [[Default Nametag]]. It has black text and a white outline.

